      "segment_id": "seg_amdahl_formula",
      "spoken_text": "That reasoning fits in one line. Call the parallel share of the work p, and the number of cores N. The serial share is one minus p. The parallel share, spread over N cores, becomes p divided by N. The speedup is one divided by their sum.",
